      <h1 class="ed-title">Refurbished Treadmills: Are They Worth It?</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        “Refurbished” can mean a factory-rebuilt machine with a warranty close to new, or a used treadmill that someone has wiped down. The word tells you almost nothing; the paperwork tells you everything.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
